1. **Google Test**: A popular testing framework for C++ that provides a robust set of tools for writing and running unit tests. (Google, 2023)
2. **C++ Core Guidelines**: A set of best practices and rules for writing high-quality C++ code. (Stroustrup, 2014)
3. **Clang**: A powerful compiler that can be used to compile C++ code and provides extensive diagnostics and warnings. (LLVM, 2023)

